        "message": "LU-20352 lnet: better error reporting for md\n\nAdd CERROR() messages to the validation failure paths in\nlnet_md_build() so that an -EINVAL return can be traced\nback to the specific check that rejected the MD: a kiov\nentry extending past PAGE_SIZE, and an illegal max_size\nin both the kiov and contiguous cases. Previously, these\npaths returned -EINVAL with no indication of which check\nfailed.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I837220c479f8d051ae710e782b5642f87f0cffc7\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/66590\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Chris Horn <chorn@ddn.com>\nReviewed-by: James Simmons <jsimmons@infradead.org>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
